scenario: A sheep strays
id: arch3.sheep-out
kind: nominal
version: 1.0
status: in use
goal: The flock is seen and counted, then a sheep leaves the zone: the operator is warned, the patrol goes on.
description: 3 - Centralized orchestrator. One moment of the mission; what leads there is in its preconditions.
author: MBSE Shepherd, Part 3
date: 2026-11-04
tags: part3, architecture 3
given: arch3.mission-start

phase Guarding the flock

  step flock: pasture sends Sheep Signature
    note: The observation goes through the orchestrator, which dispatches it to the sheep monitoring.
    then soi.sm is Sheep Monitoring
    then soi.orch is Patrolling

  step sheep-out: pasture sends Sheep Out Of Zone
    note: A sheep leaves the zone: report to the orchestrator, which alerts the operator.
    then soi.sm is Sheep Monitoring
    then soi.orch is Patrolling
    then message Sheep Exit Alert
